	<key>readme</key>
	<string># Selected Text Chrome Window

Press Hyper+O (`⌃⌥⇧⌘O`) while text is selected in macOS to open that text in a new normal Google Chrome window.

This workflow uses an Alfred Hotkey trigger configured to pass selected macOS text into an AppleScript action. If the selected text does not include a URL scheme, the workflow prepends `https://`.

Requires Alfred 5 with Powerpack and Google Chrome. macOS may request permission for Alfred to read selected text and control Chrome.

Author: Yuri Parsons • https://www.ninjakitty.net
</string>
